From 5201e0bd4bb70c2324fa73113ad53b55ebc36443 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vishnu Saini <vishnu.saini@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:14:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] FROMLIST: arm64: defconfig: Enable Waveshare DSI panel
 and touch GPIO drivers

Enable the Waveshare DSI touch GPIO/backlight controller driver and the
Jadard JD9365DA-H3 DSI panel driver, as modules, for the Waveshare 8
inch DSI panel on the 22-pin JDISP1 DSI0 connector on the Qualcomm Shikra
EVK, Talos Lyra EVK boards.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261021-shikra_display_overlays-v1-6-adaea735999f@oss.qualcomm.com/]
Signed-off-by: Vishnu Saini <vishnu.saini@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261021-shikra_display_overlays-v1-6-adaea735999f@oss.qualcomm.com/
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 1259b03a28d7..9322d4aedfe7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -723,6 +723,7 @@ CONFIG_GPIO_SYSCON=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_UNIPHIER=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_VF610=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_VISCONTI=y
+CONFIG_GPIO_WAVESHARE_DSI_TOUCH=m
 CONFIG_GPIO_WCD934X=m
 CONFIG_GPIO_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_XGENE_SB=y
@@ -1021,6 +1022,7 @@ CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112A=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112B=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9881C=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9882T=m
+CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_JADARD_JD9365DA_H3=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_KHADAS_TS050=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_MANTIX_MLAF057WE51=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_NOVATEK_NT36672A=m
-- 
2.34.1
